PN,30301
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,FFour people, including a child, have
OL,7,Fbeen killed in Russian attacks on Kyiv
OL,8,Fand the surrounding areas, officials
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FTwo grandparents and their three-year-
OL,12,Fold grandson were killed after
OL,13,Fmultiple Russian drones destroyed
OL,14,Ftheir home in Brovary, northeast of
OL,15,Fthe Ukrainian capital, early on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,FThree other members of the same
OL,7,Ffamily, including a 15-year-old, and a
OL,8,Fneighbour who came to their aid were
OL,9,Falso hospitalised, local authorities
OL,10,Fsaid, as the attack reduced the house
OL,11,Fto rubble.
OL,13,FUkrainian President Volodymyr
OL,14,FZelenskyy said at least one other
OL,15,Fperson had also died in Kyiv city in a
OL,16,Fstrike "involving six ballistic
OL,17,Fmissiles against civilian
OL,18,Finfrastructure".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,FZelenskyy issued his condolences to
OL,7,Fthe families of those killed and their
OL,8,Floved ones.
OL,10,FUkraine's air force said it had downed
OL,11,For intercepted 135 of 151 drones
OL,12,Flaunched by Russia overnight.
OL,14,FRussia has continued to hit civilian
OL,15,Fareas of Ukraine, despite Moscow
OL,16,Finsisting its forces only target
OL,17,Fmilitary facilities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,FZelenskyy has pleaded with other
OL,7,Fcountries, especially the US, to send
OL,8,Fmore of the ammunition which has been
OL,9,Fmade more scarce by the Iran war.
OL,11,FThe Ukrainian leader also wants to
OL,12,Fmake Patriot ammunition in Ukraine or
OL,13,Fgain permission from Elon Musk to use
OL,14,Fhis Starlink satellite communications
OL,15,Fsystem to guide strikes inside Russia
OL,16,Fthat can hit its missile launchers.
OL,18,FHe appealed on X for "more pressure"
OL,19,Fto be applied on Russian President
OL,20,FVladimir Putin, and called for more
OL,21,Fweapons to help protect Ukrainians.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,F"Anti-ballistic capabilities,
OL,7,Finterceptor missiles for Patriot, SAMP/
OL,8,FT, NASAMS, Hawk, and our F-16s ` all
OL,9,Fof this works and helps protect lives
OL,10,Fwhen it is here, in Ukraine, rather
OL,11,Fthan sitting in warehouses thousands
OL,12,Fof kilometres away from Russian
OL,13,Fstrikes against life," Zelenskyy said.
OL,15,FEarlier this week, six people were
OL,16,Fwounded in Russia when a fire broke
OL,17,Fout at the Ilsky Oil Refinery in the
OL,18,Fsouthern Krasnodar region, due to
OL,19,Fdebris from a falling drone, local
OL,20,Fofficials said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,FUkraine's General Staff said Ukrainian
OL,7,Fforces struck the refinery in
OL,8,FKrasnodar, along with the Syzran Oil
OL,9,FRefinery in the Samara region, more
OL,10,Fthan 800 kilometres (500 miles) inside
OL,11,FRussia.
OL,13,FThe governor of Russia's Samara
OL,14,Fregion, Vyacheslav Fedorishchev, said
OL,15,Fdrones hit an "industrial enterprise,"
OL,16,Fbut did not mention the refinery.
OL,26,@wD@OOUwD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,FUkraine's almost daily long-range
OL,7,Fdrone and missile strikes using
OL,8,Fdomestically developed weapons have
OL,9,Fbattered Russian oil facilities for
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FSaturday's attacks come after
OL,13,FZelenskyy arrived for his first
OL,14,Fofficial visit to Serbia to meet with
OL,15,Fthe President Aleksandar Vucic and
OL,16,FPrime Minister Djuro Macut.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,FZelenskyy said they had discussed "the
OL,7,Fchallenges of the coming winter" due
OL,8,Fto Russian strikes and almost no
OL,9,Fthermal power plants in Ukraine
OL,10,Fremaining in tact, as well as economic
OL,11,Fdevelopment and infrastructure.
OL,13,F"We also touched on relations with the
OL,14,FEuropean Union. We will be glad if
OL,15,FSerbia's path to the EU accelerates,"
OL,16,Fhe said in a statement on X shared on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
