PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786227478
OL,3,CChild among four people killed by
OL,4,CRussian strikes on Ukraine
OL,6,F"It is important that every nation in
OL,7,FEurope receives a clear signal that it
OL,8,Fis needed in Europe and that no one
OL,9,Fcan be lost."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
